{
  "_what": "Opt-in 'use my connection': this Mac relays the network streams of a cloud AI over one authenticated WebSocket (computer/egress-relay.mjs), so a tool behind the person's own network can be reached only through their machine. Off unless `on` is true. Nothing is relayed to a private or reserved address unless `allow_private_targets` is true; every name is resolved first and the policy is checked on the address that will be connected. `path` is the account address the Mac attaches to (computer/mac-tools.mjs starts the relay beside the live connection when `on` is true).",
